# NeizvesnY AI Companion v0.2 - offline experimental follow + defend
# Paste these instructions into a logic processor.
# Requires an allied flare unit; Mindustry Logic syntax must be tested on iOS.
ubind @flare
uradar player ally any distance 0 1 player
jump 0 equal player null
sensor px player @x
sensor py player @y
ucontrol approach px py 6 0 0
uradar enemy any any distance 0 1 enemy
jump 10 equal enemy null
sensor ex enemy @x
sensor ey enemy @y
ucontrol target ex ey 1 0 0
end
